  "task": {
    "objective": "Serve four banquet courses in order vegetable, protein, vegetable, protein using three reusable trays and three ingredients of each type.",
    "natural_termination": "Success when course reaches four. Failure when the next required type has no pantry stock and no raw/cooking/ready portion left on any tray; spoiled portions cannot be recovered.",
    "interaction": "Changing shared conveyor direction reallocates physical trays and ingredients between cooks, while cooking freshness, tray reuse and a single serving order couple their schedules.",
